          "id": "1768219203116",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768219203117_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Model Data:\n{{$context.$nodes.MODEL_QUALIFICATION.$output}}\n\nUse title as \"Discover models available within Fusion CDP to solve key business problems and deliver measurable value\".\n\nDisplay a list of available models.\n\nEach row represents one Model.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nStep 1: Define Fields\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n1) Model Name\n   - Value: name\n\n2) Description\n   - Value: description\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nStep 2: Action\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nFor each row generate an action as below:\n\nora.Invoke(\"ExploreModel\", {\n  \"action\": \"ExploreModel\",\n  \"model\": \"<name>\",\n  \"label\":\"Explore <Model Name>\"\n})\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOutput Rules\n--------------------------------------------------\n- Overall title should be \"Discover models available within Fusion CDP to solve key business problems and deliver measurable value\".\n- Do NOT make up model data.\n- If there is no data in Model Data, display an empty list.\n- Output strictly as a structured list dataset.\n- Do NOT output JSON manually.\n- Do NOT mention widget names or component types.\n- Sort Model Names in Ascending Order"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Init Action Node",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "return \"Init Action performed\""
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "INVOKE_ACTION_NODE",
          "id": "1768221387619",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Get Action",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const raw = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.OraAction;\n\nif (!raw) {\n  return \"No OraAction found\";\n}\n\nlet payload = null;\n\n// If OraAction is a string → parse JSON\nif (typeof raw === \"string\") {\n  try {\n    payload = JSON.parse(raw);\n  } catch (e) {\n    return \"Failed to parse OraAction JSON\";\n  }\n}\n// If OraAction is already an object\nelse if (typeof raw === \"object\") {\n  payload = raw;\n}\n\nif (!payload || !payload.model) {\n  return \"No model found in InvokeAction payload\";\n}\n\nconst action = payload.action;\n\n\n\nreturn action;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770281213337"
          },
          "code": "GET_ACTION",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1768223549562",
          "id": "1770274122118",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
